WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
The goal is to put every toy in the box and wipe the table. Learned predicates connect top-down camera observations to the symbolic state.

00:06.000 --> 00:20.000
The LLM proposes predicate effect vectors. Demonstrated transitions provide effect-based supervision for neural classifiers. Training and validation feedback guides the next proposal. The feature-space animation is schematic.

00:20.000 --> 00:26.000
The planner uses the goal, ground atoms, and learned preconditions. Wiping requires the toys to be cleared and the towel to be grasped first.

00:26.000 --> 01:12.500
Complete table-cleaning demonstration: pick and place three toys into the box, grasp the towel, then wipe away the debris. Original footage at three times recorded speed.
